#
# Requested:
#   Item 1: IPU3/IPU6 + VSC + IPU_BRIDGE + common OV/IMX/HI/GC/S5K sensors
#   Item 2: HID_LOGITECH + DJ + HIDPP (+ LEDS_CLASS_MULTICOLOR dep, FF)
#   Item 3: INPUT_JOYDEV, JOYSTICK_XPAD (+FF/LEDs), HID_STEAM
