#   INPUT_AMD_SFH_TABLETMODE — 7.3-only (Ubuntu 26.10 has it)
#   VIDEO_IMX471 — not in 7.2.6 tree
#
# Parents / selects olddefconfig filled:
#   VIDEOBUF2_DMA_SG, V4L2_CCI(+_I2C), INTEL_PMT_CLASS/DISCOVERY,
#   INTEL_PMC_SSRAM/PWRM_TELEMETRY, AMD_HSMP, INTEL_SCU_IPC,
#   LOGIRUMBLEPAD2_FF, LOGIWHEELS_FF
# STAGING=y only for VIDEO_IPU3_IMGU; IPU7 and atomisp left off.
# Built /boot/config-7.2.6-lunduke is byte-identical to this file.
#
# Unified diff of full .config follows.
#
